{
  "description": "Threat model for the Dustnet client. Authoritative source for the adversaries assumed hostile and for the control and evidence answering each. Read by tools/allocation-audit: an adversary with no coverage row, a row naming an undeclared property, or a row whose evidence is neither a test function nor a make target fails the build. docs/spec/07-security.md describes the controls in prose.",
  "trusted": [
    "operating system",
    "terminal emulator"
  ],
  "out_of_scope": [
    "compromised hosts",
    "malicious operator-installed server extensions"
  ],
  "properties": [
    "origin isolation",
    "terminal integrity",
    "bounded resource use",
    "local confidentiality"
  ],
  "adversaries": [
